  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1:\n- Fixed DrawTextInRect double-offset bug for reliable text positioning\n- Fixed radial gauge progress value and subtitle text centering\n- Fixed bubble chart clipping and added margin for hit-testing\n- Added TextAlignment property and inner padding in Funnel and Pyramid charts\n- Enlarged and padded zoom badge in LengkoChartBase\n- Added boundary margins to Scatter, Candlestick, OHLC, BoxPlot, ErrorBar, Line, and Area charts\n- Enhanced WPF demo showcase with titled cards, 6 categorized tabs, and dark mode",
